# Ignore everything by default
*

# Allow these files/folders
!.gitignore
!web
!web/**
!README.md
# Root app (for Vercel build when Root Directory not set) – allow Admin pages so build passes
!src
!src/**

# Node artifacts anywhere (extra safety if web/ nested installs leave traces)
**/node_modules/
**/.env*
**/.DS_Store
**/dist/
**/.vercel


